WEBVTT

00:13:23.356 --> 00:13:31.522
(Aplauz)

00:13:31.522 --> 00:13:33.669
To je bio jedini put da me je tata

00:13:33.669 --> 00:13:35.948
video na živom nastupu

00:13:35.948 --> 00:13:39.212
i ovaj govor posvećujem njemu.

00:13:39.212 --> 00:13:41.375
(Arapski)

00:13:41.375 --> 00:13:44.226
Ja sam Mejsun Zajid,

00:13:44.226 --> 00:13:47.243
i ako ja mogu ovo, možete i vi.

00:13:47.243 --> 00:13:52.444
(Aplauz)